    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Submitting a complaint",
     "texto": [
      "**A depune o reclamație** means \"to submit a complaint\". **Produs defect** describes a product that does not work as it should."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement",
     "texto": [
      "**Deteriorat** agrees with a masculine noun; **deteriorată**, with a feminine one, such as **piesă**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
